NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000414 "=head1 SOURCE"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000415 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000416 "Source repository is at L<https://github.com/perlancar/perl-Text-Table-Sprintf>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000417 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000418 "=head1 SEE ALSO"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000419 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000420 "L<Text::Table::Tiny>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000421 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000422 "Other text table modules listed in L<Acme::CPANModules::TextTable>. The selling"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000423 "point of Text::Table::Sprintf is performance and light footprint (just about two"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000424 "pages of code that does not use I<any> module, core or otherwise)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000425 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000426 "=head1 AUTHOR"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000427 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000428 "perlancar <perlancar@cpan.org>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000429 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000430 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000431 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000432 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000433 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000434 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000435 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000436 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000437 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000438 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000439 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000440 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000441 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000442 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000443 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000444 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000445 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000446 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000447 ""
