NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000455 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000456 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000457 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=Text-Table-Sprintf>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000458 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000459 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000460 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000461 "feature."
